Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
Content-Disposition: inline

Source: doxygen
Version: 1.8.13-10
Severity: normal
Tags: patch
User: debian-alpha@lists.debian.org
Usertags: alpha

Hi!

LLVM is currently not being built for the alpha architecture as the Alpha
backend has been removed upstream. This makes doxygen BD-Uninstallable on
this architecture.

In order to fix this, please disable LLVM support in doxygen on alpha.

Adrian

